title: "Headlight: dependency-aware predictive orchestration for Kubernetes multi-cluster federations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Stefanov"
    given-names: "Dimitar"
    affiliation: "Sunesis d.o.o., Ljubljana, Slovenia"
