version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-10"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dstefanov46/headlight-softwarex"
url: "https://github.com/dstefanov46/headlight-softwarex"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  Headlight is an open-source experimental orchestration stack for predictive
  autoscaling and availability-aware replica placement across Kubernetes
  multi-cluster federations managed by Karmada. It combines a
  service-dependency-aware probabilistic forecaster with a declarative
  execution layer and includes reproducible experiment tooling, baseline
  controllers, workload profiles, validation gates, and documentation.
keywords:
  - "Kubernetes"
  - "Karmada"
  - "multi-cluster orchestration"
  - "predictive autoscaling"
  - "graph neural networks"
  - "edge-cloud continuum"
